<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 272)</h2>
<p><b>Web marks land exactly where the app is looking.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The app's session is now the single authority for frame numbering in web shares — the one-frame drift between web markup and the app playhead is gone. Verified: web drives to a frame, the app lands on exactly that frame; a web drawing appears in the app on the same frame, immediately visible.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
